{
  "schema": "ancora.parity.scenario.v1",
  "id": "s08-time-restrictions",
  "title": "Time restrictions (D9a): the period grid, and activity type, subject, cohort, teacher and room cells",
  "notes": [
    "Issue #70, D9a (legacy-parity-inventory.md PAR-070..072, A-4/P-2; SQL case 139). One plan and period (5 days x 4 slots), two groups, two subjects, two teachers, two rooms.",
    "Legacy side: the period cells through the legacy period grid (get_form_edit_Periodo_restricciones, then custom_set_Restricciones_Periodo with the whole grid, as ancoragoh_client_forms_periodo.js posts it); the other kinds, which the 2010 UI could not edit, through the generated add_RestriccionDe<Class> handlers, one per cell, valor 1 and por_actividad false. Drupal side: TimeRestrictionGrid, the save of the grid form.",
    "The manual restriction rows of the six tables are compared (por_actividad false); their real-date rows are in the row counts of the other tables. The placements must be equal on both sides.",
    "The characterization steps (legacy only, after the comparison) record that a second row for a cell is refused (UNIQUE, HTTP 500) and that saving the period grid with no cell removes its rows."
  ],
  "users": [
    {"key": "admin", "name": "Administrator", "legacy": "seeded-admin"},
    {"key": "alice", "name": "Alice Planner"}
  ],
  "records": [
    {"type": "plan", "key": "P", "as": "alice", "label": "Semester", "starts_on": "2026-09-07", "duration_days": 30},
    {"type": "period", "key": "W", "as": "alice", "plan": "P", "label": "Week", "days": 5, "slots_per_day": 4, "start_hour": 8, "slot_duration": 1, "plan_days": [1]},
    {"type": "activity_type", "key": "C1", "as": "alice", "label": "Lecture", "duration_slots": 1, "priority": 1, "cost": 1},
    {"type": "specialty", "key": "E", "as": "alice", "label": "Program"},
    {"type": "level", "key": "N", "as": "alice", "label": "Year 1"},
    {"type": "cohort", "key": "B1", "as": "alice", "label": "Cohort 1", "specialty": "E", "level": "N", "enrollment": 20},
    {"type": "cohort", "key": "B2", "as": "alice", "label": "Cohort 2", "specialty": "E", "level": "N", "enrollment": 20},
    {"type": "student_group", "key": "G1", "as": "alice", "plan": "P", "label": "Group 1", "activity_type": "C1", "specialty": "E", "level": "N", "cohorts": ["B1"]},
    {"type": "student_group", "key": "G2", "as": "alice", "plan": "P", "label": "Group 2", "activity_type": "C1", "specialty": "E", "level": "N", "cohorts": ["B2"]},
